      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Only four cases of tracheopathia osteoplastica have been reported in Britain in the past 110 years. Ten further cases are now reported; in two the diagnosis was made at bronchoscopy. It is suggested that the reputed rarity of the condition in Britain is not the whole picture."},
